{"parse": {"title": "箱装荐言", "pageid": 100489, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"箱装荐言\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/57/Item-252701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"箱装荐言\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>箱装荐言</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#252701</div></div><hr /><div>笼罩着浓厚雾气的箱式相簿。开启后可从中挑选指定的6星角色到访。可自选角色将随主线故事进度解锁。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">为司辰准备的人员名单，专为漫长旅途而推荐。拭去水汽，瞧瞧吧——那是你最耳熟能详的朋友。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "箱装荐言"}}